12
00:01:02,109 --> 00:01:02,939
The father.

13
00:01:03,340 --> 00:01:04,314
Anton Reiss.

14
00:01:05,373 --> 00:01:11,552
The narrator asked you, twenty-one chapters ago, to
hold on to Anton Reiss. He was the

15
00:01:11,572 --> 00:01:17,679
Absolute scientist who, at eleven minutes past four
in the morning on the eleventh of

16
00:01:17,699 --> 00:01:24,166
June 2047, sent a nine-word message against a standing
