23
00:01:48,784 --> 00:01:54,663
Four years ago. It took. He is the second one, and I
did not tell you, and I am telling

24
00:01:54,683 --> 00:02:00,496
you now because you asked me in 2047 to tell you
before rather than after, and this is

25
00:02:00,516 --> 00:02:01,242
