26
00:02:01,641 --> 00:02:08,154
The narrator notes that Albert Wesker stood in a
corridor on the ice and was, for the

27
00:02:08,174 --> 00:02:13,687
second time in sixty-two years, not entirely
in control of his own face.

28
00:02:14,209 --> 00:02:15,938
You have made a species.

29
00:02:16,338 --> 00:02:21,493
I've made a family. Whether it becomes a species is
a question for about nine hundred

30
00:02:21,513 --> 00:02:26,668
years, and neither of us is going to be able to
stop it being one, and I have thought

31
00:02:26,688 --> 00:02:28,617
