will never once contact her.

38
00:02:57,066 --> 00:02:58,775
(very soft) Yes.

39
00:02:59,175 --> 00:03:00,005
That was quick.

40
00:03:00,406 --> 00:03:07,147
I have had forty-one years to work out what I would
say, Dr. Marsh. I have known this

41
00:03:07,167 --> 00:03:14,147
was coming since the eighteenth of June 2047, when a
