58
00:04:30,615 --> 00:04:35,841
You can hold her. She's not going to break, she's the
least breakable object in the building.

59
00:04:36,242 --> 00:04:37,772
(very soft) No.

60
00:04:38,172 --> 00:04:38,982
Why not?

61
00:04:39,932 --> 00:04:46,526
Because in sixty-two years I have touched four
things that I did not intend to own, and

62
00:04:46,546 --> 00:04:53,216
I have no experience whatsoever of the category, and
I would rather not begin by getting

63
00:04:53,236 --> 00:04:56,562
it wrong with the first member
of a species.

64
00:04:56,961 --> 00:05:03,588
Evelyn Marsh laughed at him, which nobody had done
since Catherine Adeyemi died, and put

65
00:05:03,608 --> 00:05:10,007
her daughter in his arms anyway, and the narrator
records that Albert Wesker held her

66
00:05:10,027 --> 00:05:14,992
