did not say a single word.

67
00:05:15,391 --> 00:05:18,834
The lineage did not stay private for
twenty-seven weeks.

68
00:05:19,233 --> 00:05:25,193
A midwife in Raccoon City who had been flown to
Antarctica and back under a confidentiality

69
00:05:25,213 --> 00:05:30,909
undertaking she had signed without reading declined,
on the fourth of November, to keep

70
00:05:30,929 --> 00:05:36,494
