77
00:06:02,033 --> 00:06:07,223
Dr. Marsh. Did you create a heritable
modification of the human germ line?

78
00:06:07,624 --> 00:06:08,201
Yes.

79
00:06:08,601 --> 00:06:10,252
Under whose authority?

80
00:06:10,651 --> 00:06:16,375
My own. There was no other available. The Accord
governs compelled obedience; it is silent

81
00:06:16,395 --> 00:06:22,183
on this. No state has jurisdiction at that site. My
employer did not know until four months

82
00:06:22,203 --> 00:06:26,841
