permanently, and heritably?

85
00:06:37,411 --> 00:06:38,564
(very soft) Yes.

86
00:06:38,964 --> 00:06:40,214
And your defence?

87
00:06:41,165 --> 00:06:46,909
I do not have one. I have an explanation, which is that
I did it because I could and because

88
00:06:46,929 --> 00:06:52,485
