108
00:08:24,027 --> 00:08:25,516
and falling slowly.

109
00:08:25,797 --> 00:08:31,692
(very soft) There is no scenario in my model in which
those two populations remain equals

110
00:08:31,712 --> 00:08:37,542
for more than about six hundred years. Not because
the lineage will oppress anyone — Dr.

111
00:08:37,562 --> 00:08:43,258
Marsh has built the gentlest thing I have ever
modelled — but because one of them will

112
00:08:43,278 --> 00:08:45,185
